{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3c <strong>One Brick at a Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/Building-gif.gif?t=1751304138\" /></div>No timers. No pressure. Just the quiet joy of placing bricks and watching something take shape. Build alone or together on a shared screen. Maybe a tiny cottage, maybe a wobbly tower, maybe something only you understand. That\u2019s the fun of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Every Shape Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/choosing-bricks.gif?t=1751304138\" /></div>Pick from curated sets of bricks (from ramps and slates, to tiny details) and mix them however you like! Each palette is like opening a new box of building toys. Mix and match pieces, follow a feeling, or just stack whatever makes you smile. There\u2019s no wrong way to build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Make It Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/Choosing-colors.gif?t=1751304138\" /></div>Pick from a cozy palette filled with warm reds, deep greens, soft creams, and sunny yellows. Maybe your build wants a cheerful roof, a quiet brick wall, or a splash of something unexpected. Try things out, follow your mood, and see where the colors take you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ohh, and did I mention it? You can\u00a0share your builds as step-by-step blueprints for others to enjoy! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What will you build? Unwind, create, and find joy. One brick at a time. \ud83e\udde1</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827570?t=1751304138","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827570?t=1751304138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/1884223cb964e881635bf80df206204e76b85588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751304138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/1884223cb964e881635bf80df206204e76b85588/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751304138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3c <strong>One Brick at a Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/Building-gif.gif?t=1751304138\" /></div>No timers. No pressure. Just the quiet joy of placing bricks and watching something take shape. Build alone or together on a shared screen. Maybe a tiny cottage, maybe a wobbly tower, maybe something only you understand. That\u2019s the fun of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Every Shape Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/choosing-bricks.gif?t=1751304138\" /></div>Pick from curated sets of bricks (from ramps and slates, to tiny details) and mix them however you like! Each palette is like opening a new box of building toys. Mix and match pieces, follow a feeling, or just stack whatever makes you smile. There\u2019s no wrong way to build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Make It Yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/Choosing-colors.gif?t=1751304138\" /></div>Pick from a cozy palette filled with warm reds, deep greens, soft creams, and sunny yellows. Maybe your build wants a cheerful roof, a quiet brick wall, or a splash of something unexpected. Try things out, follow your mood, and see where the colors take you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ohh, and did I mention it? You can\u00a0share your builds as step-by-step blueprints for others to enjoy! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What will you build? Unwind, create, and find joy. One brick at a time. \ud83e\udde1</p>","developers":["Anawim studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/f4dbec718401076b63ed89dc81bc5ee1406abfa1/header.jpg?t=1751304138","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Anawim Studios Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158441,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158441/movie480.mp4?t=1751304134","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158441/movie_max.mp4?t=1751304134"},"name":"Gameplay Preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158441/b5b16b0ca5eeca120f4a8ae5457537e79bf34f68/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751304